DESCRIPTION:The Dead Ducks\, finally having moved on from the blasted waste
 land of comedy\, are perturbed to be invited to the hilltop stately home of
  a former colleague. As punchlines and corpses begin to pile up\, the choic
 e is made clear: commit to the bit or risk being the next body found in the
  parlour. Will help arrive before daybreak? Will any of the Ducks escape th
 eir grisly fate? Can no one really tell that the Cardinal is a bear? The Un
 iversity of York’s premier sketch troupe are back! Supported by Stevie Ma
 rtin’s student comedy fund.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-at
 las/event/no-ducks-left-to-give/
